        "Simulasi ": "Simulation of ",
        "Brek Kecemasan Autonomi (Autonomous Emergency Braking – AEB)": "Autonomous Emergency Braking (AEB)",
        " menunjukkan bagaimana sistem Bantuan Pemandu Lanjutan (ADAS) berfungsi mengesan objek di hadapan kenderaan dan mengaktifkan brek secara automatik apabila wujud risiko perlanggaran.": " demonstrates how the Advanced Driver Assistance System (ADAS) functions to detect objects in front of the vehicle and automatically activates the brakes when there is a risk of collision.",
        "Dalam aplikasi sebenar, sistem AEB bergantung kepada sensor seperti ": "In real applications, the AEB system relies on sensors such as ",
        "radar automotif, kamera, dan/atau LiDAR": "automotive radar, cameras, and/or LiDAR",
        " untuk mengesan halangan, mengukur jarak, serta menjejak pergerakan relatif objek terhadap kenderaan. Radar automotif, misalnya, menggunakan ": " to detect obstacles, measure distance, and track the relative movement of objects against the vehicle. Automotive radar, for example, uses ",
        "gelombang elektromagnetik frekuensi radio": "radio frequency electromagnetic waves",
        " bagi mengukur parameter seperti jarak dan kelajuan dengan tepat.": " to measure parameters such as distance and speed accurately.",
        "Bagi tujuan simulasi ini, ": "For the purpose of this simulation, ",
        "sensor ultrasonik diaplikasikan untuk mewakili konsep pengesanan objek berasaskan radar": "an ultrasonic sensor is applied to represent the concept of radar-based object detection",
        ". Sensor ini beroperasi dengan memancarkan gelombang bunyi dan menerima kembali gelombang pantulan daripada objek. Jarak objek kemudiannya dianggarkan berdasarkan sela masa yang diambil untuk gelombang tersebut berpatah balik ke sensor.": ". This sensor operates by emitting sound waves and receiving reflected waves back from the object. The object's distance is then estimated based on the time taken for the waves to return to the sensor.",
        "Sekiranya objek dikesan menghampiri pada jarak yang kritikal dan menimbulkan risiko perlanggaran, sistem akan serta-merta menghantar isyarat kepada aktuator brek untuk melaksanakan ": "If an object is detected approaching at a critical distance and poses a risk of collision, the system will immediately send a signal to the brake actuator to perform ",
        "brek kecemasan secara automatik": "automatic emergency braking",
        ".": ".",
        "Pengesanan Objek → Pengukuran Jarak → Penilaian Risiko Perlanggaran → Arahan Brek → Kenderaan Berhenti": "Object Detection → Distance Measurement → Collision Risk Assessment → Braking Command → Vehicle Stops",
        "Secara kesimpulannya, walaupun simulasi ini hanya menggunakan sensor ultrasonik, prinsip operasi asasnya secara tepat mencerminkan fungsi sebenar sistem AEB di dunia nyata, iaitu: ": "In conclusion, although this simulation only uses an ultrasonic sensor, its basic operating principle accurately reflects the actual function of the AEB system in the real world, namely: ",
        "mengesan halangan, menilai potensi perlanggaran, dan mengambil tindakan brek proaktif secara automatik sebelum perlanggaran berlaku.": "detecting obstacles, evaluating potential collisions, and taking proactive braking action automatically before a collision occurs.",
        "Kamera AI (HuskyLens) — Object Recognition & Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)": "AI Camera (HuskyLens) — Object Recognition & Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)",
