        "Dalam simulasi ini, Arduino Uno bertindak sebagai ": "In this simulation, the Arduino Uno acts as a ",
        "model ringkas Unit Kawalan Elektronik (ECU)": "simple model of an Electronic Control Unit (ECU)",
        ". Maklumat daripada sensor IR, kamera AI atau sensor jarak diterima dan diproses berdasarkan logik kawalan yang telah diprogramkan. Arduino kemudiannya menghasilkan isyarat kawalan seperti ": ". Information from IR sensors, AI cameras or distance sensors is received and processed based on programmed control logic. The Arduino then generates control signals such as ",
        "PWM (Pulse Width Modulation)": "PWM (Pulse Width Modulation)",
        " untuk mengawal kelajuan motor atau sistem penggerak.": " to control motor speed or actuator systems.",
        "Aliran Asas Simulasi:": "Basic Simulation Flow:",
        "Sensor → Arduino Uno (ECU Simulasi) → Algoritma Kawalan → PWM → Actuator": "Sensor → Arduino Uno (ECU Simulation) → Control Algorithm → PWM → Actuator",
        "Konsep ini mewakili fungsi asas ECU dalam kenderaan sebenar, iaitu ": "This concept represents the basic function of an ECU in a real vehicle, which is ",
        "menerima data penderia, membuat keputusan berdasarkan perisian kawalan dan menghantar arahan kepada aktuator": "receiving sensor data, making decisions based on control software, and sending commands to actuators",
        "Dalam kenderaan sebenar, fungsi kawalan tidak dilaksanakan oleh satu mikropengawal sahaja. Sebuah kenderaan moden mempunyai pelbagai ECU atau modul kawalan yang mengendalikan fungsi tertentu secara berasingan (nod-nod mandiri), contohnya:": "In a real vehicle, control functions are not executed by a single microcontroller. A modern vehicle has various ECUs or control modules that handle specific functions independently (standalone nodes), for example:",
        "ADAS / Camera ECU": "ADAS / Camera ECU",
        " – memproses maklumat daripada kamera dan mengesan objek atau lorong.": " – processes information from cameras and detects objects or lanes.",
        "ABS / ESC ECU": "ABS / ESC ECU",
        " – mengawal sistem brek dan kestabilan kenderaan.": " – controls braking systems and vehicle stability.",
        "Steering ECU": "Steering ECU",
        " – mengawal bantuan atau arahan sistem stereng.": " – controls steering system assistance or commands.",
        "Powertrain ECU": "Powertrain ECU",
        " – mengawal enjin atau sistem pemacu elektrik.": " – controls the engine or electric drive system.",
        "Body Control Module (BCM)": "Body Control Module (BCM)",
        " – mengawal pelbagai fungsi badan kenderaan.": " – controls various vehicle body functions.",
        "ECU-ECU tersebut perlu bertukar maklumat supaya setiap sistem dapat bertindak secara terselaras. Komunikasi ini lazimnya menggunakan sistem rangkaian automotif seperti ": "These ECUs need to exchange information so each system can act in a coordinated manner. This communication typically uses automotive network systems like ",
